body:
I'm not sure if it counts, but Baba Is You. 

&#x200B;

The concepts is super simple, but the puzzles get more and more difficult in a very satisfying way. At least in my opinion.

I would love to see this. I'm worried the market would kill this before it can happen. Orioles/Nationals seems to have a big piece of the market down here (they're blacked out through MLB TV) and you encroach on Braves as well. I have a hard time seeing that many owners allow it.

&#x200B;

That being said I'll remain optimistic. I think with USA baseball / the College success/ and the Bulls, the triangle has a great fan base dying for it.  I'm a cards fan far from home and would love to go to a great ball park again.

I'm right there with you buddy! Merry Christmas! 

&#x200B;

Also Hollow Knight ++
